# systemd 서비스: 라즈베리파이가 켜지면 RMU 서버를 자동 실행
# 적용: sudo cp smartfarm-rmu.service /etc/systemd/system/
#       sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl enable --now smartfarm-rmu
# 로그: journalctl -u smartfarm-rmu -f
[Unit]
Description=Smartfarm RMU (REST API, sensors, relays, SNMP traps)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
User=pi
WorkingDirectory=/opt/smartfarm/rmu
# --trap-host: Trap을 받을 NMS 주소로 바꾸세요
ExecStart=/opt/smartfarm/venv/bin/python server.py --hardware --trap-host 192.168.0.20
Restart=always
RestartSec=3

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
